          <tr><td><code>ATLAS_<wbr />CONTEXT_<wbr />MAX_<wbr />EDGES</code><span className="block mt-1 text-xs text-faint">int · restart</span></td><td>unset</td><td>Default max scoped edges in a context/code_query bundle when the request sets no --max-edges (unset = the selected intent budget).</td></tr>
