          <tr><td><code>ATLAS_<wbr />FEEDBACK_<wbr />RANKING</code><span className="block mt-1 text-xs text-faint">bool · live</span></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Let stored record_feedback verdicts re-rank retrieval hits.</td></tr>
